# The Python scripts here are the offline data pipeline, run by GitHub
# Actions - Vercel only needs to serve the static site (index.html, app.js,
# style.css, conditions.json, the GIFs). Without this, Vercel's framework
# auto-detection sees *.py + requirements.txt and assumes this is a Python
# backend app needing an entrypoint, instead of a static site.
*.py
requirements.txt
.github/
